    "This week, {0} of completed focus, {1} active days. Today is {2}. {3}. Tap to open your dashboard.": "Cette semaine, {0} de focus terminé, {1} journées actives. Aujourd’hui, c’est {2}. {3}. Appuyez pour ouvrir votre tableau de bord.",
