    "Seven-segment display": "Paparan tujuh segmen",
    "Share a weekly goal, see real progress and find out who is studying. Your session log stays on your device.": "Kongsi matlamat mingguan, lihat kemajuan sebenar dan ketahui siapa yang sedang belajar. Log sesi anda kekal pada peranti anda.",
    "Share my weekly score": "Kongsi markah mingguan saya",
    "Share your name, level and this week's hours": "Kongsi nama, tahap dan waktu perniagaan anda minggu ini",
    "Shared scores and group membership are removed too. A linked account requires a fresh sign-in check. Keep the app open until deletion finishes.": "Markah yang dikongsi dan keahlian kumpulan juga dialih keluar. Akaun terpaut memerlukan semakan log masuk baharu. Pastikan apl dibuka sehingga pemadaman selesai.",
    "Sharing options": "Pilihan perkongsian",
    "Shield": "Perisai",
    "Shield Bearer": "Pembawa Perisai",
