    "FocusForge checks YouTube screen identifiers only when you enable Shorts or feed filters, to distinguish these screens from ordinary videos. Screen checks stay on your device and are not retained or uploaded. While a YouTube pause is visible, application window package names are checked only to close the pause when you leave; other apps’ contents are not inspected. It does not read messages, passwords or text you type. Pause decisions and their times are saved only on this device for Shield insights. Access is optional and can be turned off in Android Settings. Normal app boundaries use Usage access and Draw over other apps; the focus timer works without any of these.": "仅当您启用 Shorts 或 Feed 过滤器时，FocusForge 才会检查 YouTube 屏幕标识符，以将这些屏幕与普通视频区分开来。屏幕检查保留在您的设备上，不会保留或上传。虽然 YouTube 暂停可见，但仅检查应用程序窗口包名称以在您离开时关闭暂停；其他应用程序的内容不会被检查。它不会读取您输入的消息、密码或文本。暂停决策及其时间仅保存在此设备上，以供 Shield 洞察。访问是可选的，可以在 Android 设置中关闭。普通应用程序边界使用使用访问权限并在其他应用程序上绘制；焦点计时器无需这些即可工作。",
    "FocusForge checks YouTube screen identifiers only when you enable Shorts or feed filters, to distinguish these screens from ordinary videos. When Study channels only is enabled, visible creator names or handles on supported video pages are compared with channels you selected. Screen checks stay on your device and visible labels are not retained or uploaded. While a YouTube pause is visible, application window package names are checked only to close the pause when you leave; other apps’ contents are not inspected. It does not read messages, passwords or text you type. Pause decisions and their times are saved only on this device for Shield insights. Access is optional and can be turned off in Android Settings. Normal app boundaries use Usage access and Draw over other apps; the focus timer works without any of these.": "FocusForge 仅在您启用 Shorts 或 Feed 过滤器时检查 YouTube 屏幕标识符，以将这些屏幕与普通视频区分开来。当启用“仅研究频道”时，受支持的视频页面上可见的创建者名称或句柄将与您选择的频道进行比较。屏幕检查保留在您的设备上，并且不会保留或上传可见标签。虽然 YouTube 暂停可见，但仅检查应用程序窗口包名称以在您离开时关闭暂停；其他应用程序的内容不会被检查。它不会读取您输入的消息、密码或文本。暂停决策及其时间仅保存在此设备上，以供 Shield 洞察。访问是可选的，可以在 Android 设置中关闭。普通应用程序边界使用使用访问权限并在其他应用程序上绘制；焦点计时器无需这些即可工作。",
    "FocusForge checks YouTube screen identifiers only when you enable Shorts or feed filters. Study channels only compares visible creator names or handles with a bundled educational-creator catalog on this device. Some educational channels may not be recognized. Creator labels are not saved or uploaded. Other apps’ contents, messages, passwords and typed text are not read. Pause decisions and times stay on this device. Access is optional and can be turned off in Android Settings. Normal app boundaries use Usage access and Draw over other apps; the focus timer works without these permissions.": "仅当您启用 Shorts 或 Feed 过滤器时，FocusForge 才会检查 YouTube 屏幕标识符。学习频道仅将可见的创作者姓名或句柄与该设备上捆绑的教育创作者目录进行比较。某些教育频道可能无法被识别。不会保存或上传创建者标签。其他应用程序的内容、消息、密码和键入的文本不会被读取。暂停决定和时间保留在此设备上。访问是可选的，可以在 Android 设置中关闭。普通应用程序边界使用使用访问权限并在其他应用程序上绘制；焦点计时器无需这些权限即可工作。",
    "FocusForge is provided as-is, without warranty. Strict Mode is a commitment device you choose to enable — it does not replace emergency services, and the always allowed list is there so that it never can. You own your data; the app claims no licence over it.": "FocusForge 按原样提供，无保修。严格模式是您选择启用的承诺设备 - 它不会取代紧急服务，并且始终允许的列表就在那里，因此它永远不会取代。您拥有您的数据；该应用程序声称没有任何许可。",
    "FocusForge reads the list of apps installed on this phone and how long you used each one today, to let you choose apps to block or limit in Shield and to show your screen time on Home.": "FocusForge 会读取此手机上已安装的应用列表，以及你今天使用每个应用的时长，以便你在“屏蔽”中选择要屏蔽或限制的应用，并在“首页”显示你的屏幕使用时间。",
