    "Shorts are recognised by the names YouTube gives its own screens, not by reading what is on them. A future YouTube update can rename them, and the block would stop firing until FocusForge is updated to match.": "Shorts 短片是通过 YouTube 为自己的屏幕指定的名称来识别的，而不是通过阅读屏幕上的内容来识别。未来的 YouTube 更新可以重命名它们，并且该块将停止触发，直到 FocusForge 更新为匹配。",
    "Shorts are recognised by the names YouTube gives its own screens. Study channel filtering reads only visible creator labels on supported video pages and compares them on this device. It does not classify every video as educational. A YouTube layout update can affect recognition; full-screen pages may hide the creator.": "Shorts 识别依据的是 YouTube 为其页面使用的名称。学习频道筛选仅读取支持的视频页面上可见的创作者标签，并在本设备上进行比对，不会判断每个视频是否具有教育性。YouTube 页面布局更新可能影响识别；全屏页面可能会隐藏创作者信息。",
