    "The face changes how the figures are drawn, not what they say. The timer, the ring and the full-screen clock all read the same value.": "脸改变了人物的绘制方式，而不是他们所说的内容。计时器、响铃和全屏时钟都读取相同的值。",
    "The usage service did not answer. Pull down to try again.": "使用服务未应答。拉下来再试一次。",
