    "The window is the commitment; this is the way out.": "窗户就是承诺；这是出路。",
    "Theme": "主题",
    "These fire while a block is active, so they can be frequent.": "这些在方块处于活动状态时会触发，因此它们可能会很频繁。",
    "Thin figures and a rule": "薄型数字和规则",
    "This action is irreversible and will delete your profile, achievements, and all progress.": "此操作不可逆转，将删除您的个人资料、成就和所有进度。",
    "This build has no backend, so there is no board to read. Your own week above is measured here, on this device.": "此版本没有后端，因此没有可读取的板。上述您自己的一周是在此设备上测量的。",
    "This device does not need any extra access for the focus timer.": "该设备不需要对焦点定时器进行任何额外的访问。",
    "This focus block is unfinished. Its time will not be saved to your study log. Completed blocks stay saved.": "此对焦块未完成。它的时间不会保存到您的学习日志中。已完成的块保持保存。",
    "This month": "本月",
    "This removes your focus history, streak totals, subject progress and shield statistics from this device. Badges and weekly targets are kept. Saved cloud study history can return when you recover your account.": "这将从该设备中删除您的焦点历史记录、连胜总数、主题进度和护盾统计数据。徽章和每周目标都会被保留。当您恢复帐户时，保存的云学习历史记录可以恢复。",
    "This ring fills as you focus — it starts moving the moment a block runs, and keeps what you finish.": "当您集中注意力时，该环会填充 - 当方块运行时它就会开始移动，并保留您完成的内容。",
